      en: ["A lifeline of Southeast Asia, forming the border between Thailand and Laos. Journeying along this galactic current reveals a world of floating markets, rural life, and the elusive giant catfish, a true river monster.", "Located within the Kingdom of Thailand.", "Shaped by the monsoon climate of Southeast Asia."],
